window.products.push({"id":1191065,"name":"Smart Watches for Women, Android Fitness Watch with Blood Pressure and Heart Rate Monitor, Temperature, Menstrual Tracker, DIY Faces, 11 Sports, Weath","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cv5vpZ93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BODY FITNESS TRACKING, as a multifunction womens smart watch, it is equipped with a few features for body fitness keeping, such as blood pressure monitor, heart rate monitor, sleep tracking and body thermometer, besides all these, menstrual reminder is available, which could be used as a alert in your daily life, a must have for ladies and young girls MULTI SPORT MODES, if you are enthusiasts, this smart fitness watch for women and girls will serve a lot for you, up to 11 sport modes help you to learn activity details from different aspects, such as distance, steps, calories, heart rate, blood pressure, etc, through which, you can reach your goal step by step with a scientific method THIN AND LIGHT WEIGHT, watch fans would tell you that bulky designed smartwatches aren’t comfortable to wear, the womens fitness tracker is made of high-end ABS and silicone, which gives it a pretty light weight and slim body. One benefit of wearing a smartwatch with the slim design is the variety of styles that can suit any outfit and yet still provide comfort on the wrist LONG WORKING TIME, generally speaking, more functionality equates to a shorter battery life, however, this smart fitness tracker was designed with 2021 latest energy saving chips, which could work for your up to 30 days, you don’t need placing it on charging docks daily OTHER FUNCTIONS, as a wearable device, this smartwatch also has some other practical features, such as social media notifications, alarm clock, countdown timer, stop watch, music control, remote capture, changeable watch faces, and so on","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Cv5vpZ93L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"gandley","source_asin":"B096FQVKTB","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191065","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096FQVKTB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B096FQVKTB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1191066,"name":"NETGEAR FWG114P ProSafe 802.11g Wireless VPN Firewall 4-Port 10/100 Switch with USB Server","category":"electronics","retail price":95.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+p0GY-g+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description FWG114P PRO SAFE 802.11G Wireless FW with USBThe product is multiple voltage compatible that voltage arrange is100-240V Amazon.com Amazon.com Product Description The NETGEAR FWG114P ProSafe 802.11g Wireless VPN Firewall 4-Port 10/100 Switch with USB Server is a mouthful to say but provides your business with a router, switch, print server, wireless access point, and firewall. Instead of multiple devices and a tangle of wires, the FWG114P is all you need. Wired and Wireless Connectivity The FWG114P can connect up to 253 users onto the LAN, including 64 wireless users, to share a single broadband connection. Built in to the router is a 4-port 10/100 switch for up to four connections, as well as an 802.11g wireless access point. The wireless network supports speeds up to 54 Mbps and there is a detachable 5 dBi antenna included. A USB port allows you to connect a printer to the network that multiple users can share simultaneously. An RS-232 serial port provides a backup connection in case the main network connection fails. A row of LED lets you know the status of the network at a glance. High-class Security For more security than just a simple NAT router, the FVG318 offers significantly more protection. It provides: a Stateful Packet Inspection (SPI) firewall to prevent Denial of Service attacks, an Intrusion Detection System (IDS), the ability to block Java/URL/ActiveX based on extension, and FTP/SMTP/RPC program filtering. The FWG114P supports two simultaneous VPN tunnels to protect links between remote locations, encrypting the data between them. The wireless network is protected by 40/64-bit and 128-bit WEP encryption as well as WPA. Easy Setup Even with all the functionality the FWG114P provides, NETGEAR makes setup a breeze with the intuitive Smart Wizard that automatically detects the ISP connection and adjusts your configuration accordingly. The NETGEAR FWG114P ProSafe 802.11g Wireless VPN Firewall 4-Port 10/100 Switch with USB Server is backed by a 3-year warranty. What's in the Box FWG114P, AC power adapter, ethernet cable, installation guide, resource CD, warranty/support information card.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+p0GY-g+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NETGEAR","source_asin":"B0000DIWW2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191066","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000DIWW2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000DIWW2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
