window.products.push({"id":1191144,"name":"ROCCAT ARVO Compact Gaming Keyboard, Black","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UlDvntWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description It's no coincidence that the ROCCAT Arvo is part of the ROCCAT Smart Desktop Management System. In contrast to other keyboards, it only has a tiny desktop footprint. As a result, neither the mousepad nor mouse will get in your way - plus optimum use is made of the gaming zone. The Arvo is perfect even for arrow key gamers, who prefer to position their keyboards diagonally to the monitor and mousepad, as it doesn't collide with the monitor or hang over the edge of the desk. The smaller size has been achieved simply by combining the numpad and arrow-key pad. This means that it has all the usual keyboard functions, yet it takes up considerably less space. It's easy to switch between normal and gaming mode simply by pressing the mode switch button. In gaming mode the arrow keys are illuminated in blue which means gaming even in the dark isn't a problem. Two additional, freely programmable macro keys are available which are positioned for optimum access to the left and right of the arrow keys. You'll find three further macro keys positioned beneath the spacebar. These can be individually programmed and can be easily operated using the thumb without being pressed accidently. At last, there's something new for your thumb to do apart from just hitting the spacebar. Another unique function is the ROCCAT Timer which allows the time it takes for special items to revive to be timed to perfection in many games. The ROCCAT Timer can be executed, paused or stopped to within a fraction of a second. Because of their optimum height, keys can be pressed with particular precision. Being of medium height means they're not just comfortable for typing; they also offer a perfect pressure point. The Arvo forgives those little temper tantrums during gaming, and the thump on the edge of the desk that frequently ensues, without so much as a murmur. The rugged metal plate also means it's perfectly weighted and therefore exceptionally stable. From the Manufacturer Get more space on the desktop without the need to forgo all the usual functions with the compact ROCCAT Arvo. It's the first keyboard to offer a gaming mode integrated into the numpad and unique thumbster keys. These three extra keys can be assigned macros or the practical timer function. Compact Footprint The ROCCAT Arvo is part of the ROCCAT Smart Desktop Management System. In contrast to other keyboards, it has a very small desktop footprint. As a result, neither the mousepad nor mouse will get in your way, and optimum use is made of the gaming zone. The Arvo is perfect even for arrow key gamers, who prefer to position their keyboards diagonally to the monitor and mousepad, as it doesn't collide with the monitor or hang over the edge of the desk. Dual-Assignment Number Pad The smaller size of the ROCCAT Arvo has been achieved simply by combining the numpad and arrow-key pad. This means that it has all the usual keyboard functions, yet it takes up considerably less space. It's easy to switch between normal and gaming mode simply by pressing the mode switch button. In gaming mode, the arrow keys are illuminated in blue which means gaming even in the dark isn't a problem. Two additional, freely programmable macro keys are also available, positioned for optimum access to the left and right of the arrow keys. Unique Thumbster Keys You'll find three further macro keys positioned beneath the spacebar. These can be individually programmed and can be easily operated using the thumb without being pressed accidently so you can cast healing or attack spells with your thumb. Another unique function is the ROCCAT Timer which allows the time it takes for special items to revive to be timed to perfection in many games. The ROCCAT Timer can be executed, paused, or stopped to within a fraction of a second. Perfect Keystroke It's not just its compact design that makes the ROCCAT Arvo the perfect gaming keyboard. It also has an unusually positive keystroke. Because of their optimum height, keys can be pressed with particular precision. Being of medium height means they're not just comfortable for typing; they also offer a perfect pressure point. Integrated Metal Plate The Arvo is also very sturdy thanks to the integrated metal plate. The rugged metal plate makes it perfectly weighted and therefore exceptionally stable. Furthermore, your ideal gaming height can be achieved by folding out the lock-on keyboard legs which cling to any surface like little suction cups thanks to their non-slip coating.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UlDvntWDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROCCAT","source_asin":"B0071JXD7U","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191144","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0071JXD7U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0071JXD7U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
