window.products.push({"id":1191216,"name":"Alarm Clocks for Bedrooms, Multifunctional Clock with FM Radio & Projection, 0-100% Dimmer & Radio Volume, Curved Screen, Dual Alarms, USB Charger, Cr","category":"electronics","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715OyvlY4rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝗕𝗜𝗚 𝗟𝗘𝗗 𝗗𝗜𝗦𝗣𝗟𝗔𝗬𝗦 𝗪𝗜𝗧𝗛 𝟬-𝟭𝟬𝟬% 𝗗𝗜𝗠𝗠𝗘𝗥 -- Enjoy easy visibility from across the room with this projection alarm clock's 3.5*2inch huge numerals. The brightness of the numerals is easily adjusted from zero to very bright using a ribbed thumbwheel on the back of the case. Warm Tips: The displays -- both the projection and clock face -- can be dimmed or shut off individually. 𝗙𝗠 𝗖𝗟𝗢𝗖𝗞 𝗥𝗔𝗗𝗜𝗢 𝗪𝗜𝗧𝗛 𝟬-𝟭𝟬𝟬% 𝗩𝗢𝗟𝗨𝗠𝗘 -- This digital alarm clock supports manual/auto searching radio stations and 𝗮𝘂𝘁𝗼𝗺𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗰𝗮𝗹𝗹𝘆 𝘀𝗮𝘃𝗲𝘀 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗿𝗮𝗱𝗶𝗼 𝘀𝘁𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀 to the playlist (max 30 stations). And there is a rolling dial behind this digital clock which can adjust the radio volume from 0 to 100%. 𝗜𝗡𝗧𝗘𝗚𝗥𝗔𝗧𝗘𝗗 𝗖𝗟𝗘𝗔𝗥 𝗣𝗥𝗢𝗝𝗘𝗖𝗧𝗢𝗥 -- A must-have in your bedroom, this clock for bedroom makes life so much easier, now you just have to look at your ceiling to know what time it is, instead of using your Phone with a bright screen. The lens sends a clear image of the time on the ceiling. 𝗣𝗘𝗥𝗦𝗢𝗡𝗔𝗟𝗜𝗭𝗘𝗗 𝗔𝗟𝗔𝗥𝗠 𝗦𝗘𝗧𝗧𝗜𝗡𝗚𝗦 -- Uneasy to get up from your bed? This digital clock equipped with a snooze function and two sets of alarms to cater to your needs and those of your partner. Choose from 5 unique sounds and 3 volumes(75-85dB) levels to personalize your wake-up call. 𝗨𝗦𝗕 𝗖𝗛𝗔𝗥𝗚𝗜𝗡𝗚 𝗣𝗢𝗥𝗧 & 𝗨𝗦𝗕-𝗖 𝗣𝗢𝗪𝗘𝗥 𝗦𝗨𝗣𝗣𝗟𝗬 -- This projection clock has a 5V/1.2A USB charging port for your other electronic devices, no need to using an extra plug. It also comes with a USB-C adapter (AC100-240V,50/60Hz), the current electronic standard. The cable length is about 69.5 inches, which is enough for your nightstand. 𝗕𝗔𝗧𝗧𝗘𝗥𝗬 𝗕𝗔𝗖𝗞𝗨𝗣 𝗙𝗢𝗥 𝗠𝗘𝗠𝗢𝗥𝗬 𝗦𝗘𝗧𝗧𝗜𝗡𝗚𝗦 -- This projection alarm clock has a built-in battery backup(CR2032) that is only used to save settings in the event of a power outage. This means that during a power outage, the screen will go blank and no alarm will sound, but once power is restored, the clock will show the correct time. 𝗦𝗧𝗬𝗟𝗜𝗦𝗛 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗨𝗡𝗜𝗤𝗨𝗘 𝗖𝗨𝗥𝗩𝗘𝗗 𝗗𝗘𝗦𝗜𝗚𝗡 -- A curved screen mimics your eyes’ curvature for a more comfortable viewing experience. Research Gate reports that a Harvard Medical School study found curved screens are better at reducing eyestrain and blurred vision and improving focus compared to regular screens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715OyvlY4rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uptimus","source_asin":"B0C2HL55XM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191216","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2HL55XM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2HL55XM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
