window.products.push({"id":1191260,"name":"Minox Digital Classic Leica M3 4MP Digital Camera with Minoctar 9.6mm Digital Lens","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASmR348CL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Minox Digital Classic Camera Leica M3, 4.0 Megapixel (interpolated), Fixed Lens, Miniature Replica Digital Camera : With a unique synergy of digital photography and nostalgia - The Minox Digital Classic Camera Leica M3 is a replica of the classic Leica M3 camera in an ultra miniature format.. Simple and fast to operate, the camera is also ideal for beginners entering the world of digital photography and guarantees unlimited photographic fun for all with its innovative, striking looks. This fully functional digital camera boasts 4.0 megapixels of resolution, providing the user with sharp and detailed images. Up to 99 images can be recorded on the internal 32 MB memory, and the camera includes a USB cable for the convenient and fast transfer of the images onto a PC. The LCD display on the camera back provides information on the number of images left to shoot at any one time. 4.0 Megapixel (interpolated) for highly detailed images. 32MB Built-in memory can store up to 99 pictures. The fine detail impressively enhances the design Digital Classic Camera Leica M3. Tiny dimensions make the camera easy to carry around, serving both as a camera and a digital notebook. From the Manufacturer From the Manufacturer A unique synergy of digital photography and nostalgia--there is just no better way to describe this little Minox sensation. Minox has equipped this miniaturized Leica M3 Classic Camera of the fifties with a digital interior. The Minox DCC Leica M3 4.0 is a mini-marvel, with a miniaturized Leica M3 exterior and digital interior. Extravagance and outstanding precision mechanics have always belonged to the values fostered by Minox, which are now being transferred to the ever growing digital world. Simple and fast to operate, means that the Minox digital camera is also ideal for beginners entering the world of digital photography and guarantees unlimited photographic fun for all with its innovative, striking looks. With a resolution of 4.0 megapixels it is able to capture sharp images with high detail definition. All pictures are stored internally and can be downloaded onto a PC in a fast and easy manner using the USB cable which comes with the camera, and then processed with the software provided. The clearly laid out LCD display on the camera back presents information on the number of shots taken, at any time. A traditionally famous outer shell with digital interior--features which make the Minox DCC Leica M3 4.0 stand out among all the other digital cameras. The many metal details which accentuate the design, make the Minox DCC Leica M3 4.0 a very special item and an absolute eye-catcher among digital cameras. The exceptionally compact dimensions will make this unique digital masterpiece a constant companion, ready for action whatever the situation. It's a Minox... a digital one!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ASmR348CL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MINOX","source_asin":"B000639MX2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191260","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000639MX2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000639MX2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
