window.products.push({"id":1191269,"name":"ESSLNB Telescope for Kids Adults Astronomy Beginners 80mm Travel Scope Refractor Telescope with Tripod 10X Phone Mount and case","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-bZiLIg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5X20 Erect Image Finder Scope Generally, a finder scope appear inverted image, but our finderscope appear erect image, which is more comfortable and easier to observe, giving you different feeling for explore and view. 3X Barlow Lens The 3x Barlow lens can triple the magnification factor provided by the telescope.The barlow is placed between the eyepiece and the diagonal prism. Which Magnification?-Select the Right Eyepiece Magnifaction=Focal Length/EyepieceA lower magnification should be used for the observation of the stars. This provides a wider field of view and simplifies aiming the telescope at the desired object. The maximum magnification should be used only for particularly clear objects such as the moon, which is relatively close to the Earth and very bright, permitting good resolution of details at high magnification. Need start with your low power eyepiece and its wide viewing field will make it easier to locate objects. Once you have located an object and the view is clear you may wish to change to the high power eyepiece. WARNING NEVER aim your telescope at the sun or even close to the sun! Telescope Specification Type: RefractorAperture： 80mmFocal Length: 400mm Eyepiece1： K25mm( 16X )Eyepiece2：K9mm(44X) Finder scope： 5X20 (Erect image)Zenith Mirrors：128° erect-image diagonal mirror with 360°rotationBarlow lens： 3X Tripod:Adjustable Aluminum Tripod with tray","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-bZiLIg7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ESSLNB","source_asin":"B07G1431JT","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191269","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G1431JT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G1431JT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
