window.products.push({"id":1191337,"name":"Amplified TV Antenna, [2021 Upgraded] Smartisdeal HD Digital TV Antenna Indoor with Amplifier Signal Booster Support 4K 1080P Channels and All TVs 16.","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ubkxBLzAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smartideal Upgrade HD TV Antenna ! Tired of high monthly wire or satellite bills? Cut now! Choose the Smartideal TV antenna and enjoy the popular national TV network and local TV shows for free! Whether you're streaming in HD, 4K or HDR, you get the image quality optimized for your TV with clear detail and rich colors. Free Local Channel for Life！ The HD TV Antenna can receive include NBC, CBS, FOX, ABC, THE CW, PBS, QUBO, TELEMUNDO, UNIVISION, RTV, THIS TV, ION, ME TV and other local channels. Flat Style Antenna is specially designed for receiving digital over-the-air (OTA) TV broadcasts from all your local television Easy to Set Up Connect the antenna to “CABLE/ANT IN” on the back of any HDTV. Place it in an optimal position, usually window or on a wall. Scan for channels using your TV's 'Channel Search' and be ready to enjoy free TV! Note:The indoor TV antennas for HDTV must be connected with ATSC set-up box or digital Easy to Set Up Search Channels Available Please first visit antennaweb or antenna point to check how many broadcast towers surrounding. The actual receivable range may highly dependents on your distance and location. Areas with large obstructions such in valleys, mountains,etc,. will reduce effective range. Something Need to Notice Some sources of interference, such as air conditioners, refrigerators, hair dryers, and microwave ovens, have a certain effect on the effect of the TV antenna receiving signals. Keep the HD antenna away from those high-power devices when using it. In addition, the antenna signal strength will vary depending on the tower, terrain and weather distance. When using the antenna, you can get a better signal by moving the position of the antenna.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ubkxBLzAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smartideal","source_asin":"B08K32P5TK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191337","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K32P5TK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K32P5TK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
