window.products.push({"id":1191364,"name":"Beelink SER6 Gaming Mini PC, AMD Ryzen 5 6600H(6C/12T Up to4.5Ghz), 16G DDR5 RAM 500G PCIe 4.0 SSD Mini Desktop Computer, Radeon 660M 6Core 1.9Ghz/Wif","category":"electronics","retail price":529.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8194i7V1WIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥【AMD Ryzen 5 6600H Ultra High Efficiency】Beelink Mini PC SER6 is equipped with AMD Ryzen 5 6600H, up to 4.5GHz, 6 cores and 12 threads. The CPU of SER6 adopts the new AMD Zen3+architecture and 6nm technology. Its ultra-high performance can be compared with the 1260P of the 12th generation of Intel, but its price is much cheaper. It is a cost-effective mini computer that can be used in different scenarios, such as 4K video playback, gaming, office, education, online conference etc. 🔥【Powerful Gaming Mini PC】The new RDNA2 graphics architecture and the 6core 1900 MHz AMD Radeon 660M graphics card provides a greatly enhanced graphics processing capability, which is about 2 times of the GCN GPU, and its performance can be comparable with the general independent graphics card, gives you stronger gaming performance. Game recommendations: LOL, Dota 2, PUBG, GTA5, FORZA HORIZON 5, ULTRA STREET FIGHTER 2, MARIO KART 8, New World, CS:GO 🔥【Large Storage and Expandable Capacity】The Beelink SER6 comes with dual-channel DDR5 16GB RAM for transmission speed up to 4800MHz, which is 35% higher than DDR4. The two memory slots can be upgraded up to 64gb (2 x 32gb). Built-in 500GB PCIE 4.0 SSD with read speed up to 3500MB/s and 30% performance improvement compared with PCIE 3.0. The SER6 mini computer has an extra 2.5-inch SATA hard drive with up to 2TB of reserved space. Powerful loading and processing power for a smoother experience. 🔥【2.5G LAN + WiFi 6 + BT5.2】Ryzen 5 6600H mini pc has a 2.5Gbps Ethernet LAN (RJ45, network interface speed up to 2.5Gbps bandwidth rate), 2.5 times the traditional Gigabit 1.0Gbps. 2.4Gbps WiFi 6(802.11ax) achieves higher data transfer speeds, bringing improvements in speed efficiency and security. Also configured with bluetooth 5.2 improves the sound quality and energy efficiency of all connected audio-enabled devices, allows audio to be transmitted to multiple devices simultaneously. 🔥【4K@60Hz Triple Screen Display】Mini computer has 2*HDMI ports and 1* USB4 Type-C interface, it supports three-screen display simultaneously for multitasking. Beelink 6600H Mini Desktop Computer is pre-install with W11 Pro, also supports Linux operating system. Dual fan design with CPU fan combined with system fan, with strong heat dissipation ability, can quickly cool the computer hardware,so that the computer runs smoothly, in addition, the desktop pc supports Auto Power On and Wake On Lan.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8194i7V1WIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beelink","source_asin":"B0BZL35959","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191364","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZL35959","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZL35959","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
