window.products.push({"id":1191419,"name":"Samsung WAM250 SHAPE Wireless Audio Hub","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DddVWorPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The HubThe Hub, a small stand alone box, works with the app to allow you to connect multiple speakers into a multi room system. By simply plugging the hub into your router and connecting via the app, you can connect, group & control your speakers to customize your music to fit your life.*Shape your MusicThe Samsung SHAPE™ Wireless Audio System lets you integrate your music around how you live. Whether it’s a single speaker in one room, a multi-room system in two rooms or in every room in your home, it’s never been easier to immerse yourself in your favorite sounds.One Hub to Connect it AllTo connect all your speakers throughout your home, all that’s needed is one easy-to-use hub. You can play all your favorite tracks wirelessly and use all your favorite online music streaming services. The hub also gives you different modes of listening, including Zone Play and Party Play, letting you play tunes simultaneously on all speakers around your home or just in one room. All you need is one hub to bring your speakers, devices and music together.Sound Throughout the HomeWhen you add more speakers and a Hub, the SHAPE™ multi room system really comes to life. It’s a plug & play system, where you can add speakers throughout your home, and take complete control of your music.One System, Many OptionsUsing the Hub, app, and multiple speakers, you have incredible flexibility in how you choose to play your music. Play one song in one room, different songs from different sources in each room, one song across all speakers, or any combination that fits your mood. All simply controlled through the app.Quick, Easy SetupUnlike yesterday’s complex systems that require wiring your house, complex integration or multiple network connections, it’s quick and easy to set up a true multi-room audio system with SHAPE™. There are just 3 steps:1. Connect the hub to your home router2. Power the speakers and the hub3. Download the app.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91DddVWorPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B00GIXRKEM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191419","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GIXRKEM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GIXRKEM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
