window.products.push({"id":1191426,"name":"Driveway Alarm - Wireless PIR Motion Sensor & Outdoor Weather Resistant Detector, 36 Loud Chimes, Best DIY Home Security System, Monitor & Protect Hom","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r0AjVhwhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ DEPENDABLE HOME SECURITY SYSTEM - A motion sensor alarm is essential in a home security system. We offer the most RELIABLE outdoor motion detector on the market today. With this alert system, be alerted the moment visitors, vehicles, or even potential intruders enter your property lines, driveway, front porch, gate, shed, walkways, and garage. Great for homes, businesses, and offices. ✔ 1000 Feet TRANSMISSION & 24 Feet DETECTION RANGE - The transmission range is up to 1000 feet (the ranges from the sensor to the receiver) and the sensors' detection range is up to 24 feet. We use 2020 newest high precision technology components and improve the design of the infrared detection chip can help avoid false alarms from passing cars, small animals, or even leaves in the wind. ✔ FULLY EXPANDABLE SYSTEM - Our wireless driveway alarm sensor is fully expandable. Create up to 4 unique detection zones with 4 sensors each, simply place your motion sensor/or multiple sensors (expandable up to 16 sensors) anywhere on your property and when a person, vehicle, or large animal moves within 24 feet of the sensor’s angled eye, a signal will be sent to the receiver that will chime in your home just like a long-range doorbell. ✔ EASY TO INSTALL AND CUSTOMIZABLE ALARM MELODY - Takes only a few minutes to set up. The receiver can be powered by 3 x AA batteries or by a power adapter and the PIR sensor runs on 3 x AAA batteries. The outdoor motion sensors can be mounted to posts, walls, fences, and trees. The alarm melody for Zone 1 can be customized from 36 melodies, while melodies for Zone 2 dingdong melody, Zone 3 dripping melody, and Zone 4 alarm melody are fixed and cannot be changed. ✔ EXCELLENT QUALITY & RELIABLE SERVICE - Our driveway alert sensor system is made of industrial-grade PVC housing, rubberized weather/water-resistant seal, and has been extensively tested in extreme weather. We offer friendly and knowledgeable tech support that will help you both before and after your purchase. Package Includes: 1 x Receiver, 2 x PIR Sensors, 6 x Screws and Plugs, 1 x Screwdriver, 1 x Instruction Manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61r0AjVhwhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1 BY ONE","source_asin":"B09KM9CLMD","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191426","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KM9CLMD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KM9CLMD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
