window.products.push({"id":1191441,"name":"Audeze LCD-2 Over Ear Open Back | Shedua Wood Ring Headphones","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FwcJBEkML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MUSICALLY RICH: The warm audio presentation of the LCD2 beautifully communicates the power and nuance of your music by faithfully reproducing even the most subtle articulations within each individual voice. Couple this with It’s impressive dynamic range and what you get is a truly transcendent listening experience UNCOMPROMISED AUDIO: With smooth and clear mids, a wide open sound-stage, and a flat frequency response extending well into the sub-bass range, the LCD2 is the very embodiment of “uncompromised audio.” NEAR-ZERO DISTORTION: Engineered with the same film used by NASA, the LCD2 diaphragms are thinner than a human hair and four times larger than typical headphone diaphragms. Providing faster response times and exceptional clarity. EXCELLENCE IN DESIGN: Each aspect of the LDC2 design—lambskin leather, acoustical foam earcups, Shedua wood rings—was carefully chosen to achieve a level of comfort and sophistication that is truly worthy of the “high-end” moniker. A CUSTOM DESIGNED TRAVEL CASE which provides perfect protection for your headphones. As long as your headphones are in the closed case, they are safe from drops, spills, and other unfortunate gravitational mishaps.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FwcJBEkML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Audeze","source_asin":"B07RHC6KMC","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191441","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RHC6KMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RHC6KMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1191442,"name":"Alphacool 13178 Laing DDC310 - Single Edition - Silver Water Cooling Pumps","category":"electronics","retail price":66.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jLyDYE4vL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Alphacool's new Low Noise Edition of the Laing DDC for absolute silence! The Laing DDC pump is one of the best known pumps in the watercooling industry. Recently we have been working with Laing to take the DDC to the next level. The new Laing DDC310 was designed with a perfect balance of power and silence in mind. Unlike other versions with the plastic base we have revised the design with new superbly tuned brass housing which aids the pumps cooling and guarantees longer life especially when placed in areas with limited airflow. This new housing promises a longer life of the pump. Through the cooling fins and air flow as well as an internal thermal pad attached directly to the pump board maximum cooling is achieved. Another feature is the included decoupling option. If a pump top with a M4 threaded mounting hole, such as the Alphacool Laing DDC Acetal top is present. The special M4 screws can be screwed directly into the decoupling set and then into the case. The pump also comes as standard with an anti-vibration mounting system . Available in black nickel and silver nickel. This pump should be the first choice for your watercooling system. Technical Details Dimensions: 61 x 60 x 21mm Color: Silver nickel, black Power consumption: 10W Material: Brass, Stainless Steel, Aluminium oxide, hard coal Maximum lifting height: 2,44m Maximum system temperature: 60 ° C Maximum flow: 200l / h Voltage: 12V DC Power connector: 4 Pin Molex Tacho signal: 3-Pin Molex Scope of delivery 1x Alphacool Laing pump DDC310 1x Alphacool Laing DDC bottom metal - silver nickel 1x Thermal Decoupling mounting material Download 3D-file (.stp) Datasheet Note Not suitable for continuous operation with liquids containing titanium dioxide or glycerine. Typically, many pastel colors use these additives.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jLyDYE4vL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alphacool","source_asin":"B00ZFQB6DO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191442","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZFQB6DO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZFQB6DO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1191443,"name":"Kobra Flash Modifier Roundhead Band","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Fox3pcENL._AC_.jpg","description":"Includes: (1) Kobra Roundhead Band The new and improved base will fit the Profoto A1, Godox V1 and Godox H200R/Flashpoint eVOLV 200 Round Flash Head - Round Flash Head for AD200, and other similar units. The Kobra Flash Modifier Roundhead Band is a high-grade, flexible silicone that is not affected by high or low temperatures. The design features vent holes to allow air to circulate over the flash head and prevent the potential for overheating. *The Roundhead Band can be used with the Kobra Flash Modifier Diffuser on round flash units and is designed to work with both Godox V1, Profoto A1 gels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Fox3pcENL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kobra Flash Modifier","source_asin":"B082VLNT5Z","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191443","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082VLNT5Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B082VLNT5Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
