window.products.push({"id":1191451,"name":"Portable Mini Neck Fan (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NQVf+VhzL._AC_SL1417_.jpg","description":"Do you easily sweat when you’re outdoors? Nobody likes feeling sweaty and sticky when walking or traveling. It also doesn’t look attractive. If you’re the type who tends to sweat a lot, you know how unsightly sweat stains can be. There are many portable fans that promise to take away the heat. But few are truly comfortable to use. Most personal fans need to be held to the face, which can prove cumbersome if you're busy with work, on a hectic commute, or out hiking. With CliniqPro’s Portable Mini Neck Fan, you prevent sweat while also keeping your hands free! What’s great about our neck fan is it has double wind heads that cool you from every angle. Even when it is sweltering outside and you cannot depend on air conditioning, this mini fan will be your lifesaver. If you’re always on the go, you’ll surely enjoy your portable fan. You can use it at home when you want to save on air conditioning costs. If you’re a sports fan, this neckband is also perfect for escaping the heat of open stadiums. Aside from keeping you cool during events, this mini fan can also keep you safe while hiking or camping. It saves you from the risk of dehydration or heat stroke when temperatures soar, without taking away your ability to use your hands. Here are more reasons to love this portable mini neck fan: ✅ It’s also great for children who love to play outdoors ✅ It’s efficient and low maintenance ✅ It’s lightweight so it won’t hurt the neck ✅ It comes in a pink/white, black/red and pure white Keep cool and look it, too! Add CliniqPro’s Portable Mini Neck Fan to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NQVf+VhzL._AC_SL1417_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CliniqPro","source_asin":"B07TFSG163","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1191451","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TFSG163","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TFSG163","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
